551:`change_request_acceptance_unauthorized`.
562:are all refused with `change_request_evidence_missing`.
642:`change_request_checkpoint_index_unsynced`; an accepted record is not advanced.
657:`change_request_final_leaf_checkpoint`, naming
670:permanently with `change_request_checkpoint_conflict`. The refusal is correct and
